=== does the chunk-list divergence accumulate with uptime? ===
1200 collections per arm, 8 threads born per collection — the churn
reproducer's workload. A chunk off `@chunks` is never swept and cannot rejoin the
list, so `off-list chunks` is monotone and its slope is the leak rate.

